## Integration acceptance

- Test accepted-without-receipt, rejected, dismissed-but-unresolved and multi-channel partial results.
- Verify count changes are announced meaningfully once and do not remove access to details.
- Check shared-screen preview, private detail and actionable-message permission boundaries separately.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

